    lsm:documentation "Information about the three recognized methodologies for determining real property value: cost approach, sales comparison approach and income approach. The appraiser will identify which of the approaches were applicable in his opinion and applied in the assignment. The appraiser considers the scope of work, definition of value, subject property characteristics, and the quality and quantity of data available for each approach." ;
